OL,3,ANew storm names for 2026-2027 released
OL,4,Aby Met Office
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first of September marks the start
OL,7,Fof meteorological autumn, and with it
OL,8,Fthe start of the UK's storm season.
OL,10,FIn preparation for potential stormy
OL,11,Fspells, the Met Office has released a
OL,12,Fnew list of names for the 2026-2027
OL,13,Fseason which have been chosen by
OL,14,Fmembers of the public.
OL,16,FThis year, expect to hear the names
OL,17,FAusten, Boelo and Chloe, which are the
OL,18,Ffirst three on the alphabetical list,
OL,19,Ffollowed by Dano and Evelyn.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
