OL,3,ANew storm names for 2026-2027 released
OL,4,Aby Met Office
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorms are named by the UK Met Office,
OL,7,FIreland's Met Eireann or the
OL,8,FNetherlands' KNMI when they are
OL,9,Fforecast to cause "medium" or "high"
OL,10,Fimpacts.
